    "lyrics": {
      "text": "O_ im-pass-a-ble gate of the Lord Most High, re-joice. Re-joice, O ram-part and shel-ter for them that has-ten to thee. Tran-quil ha-ven and pure Maid-en who didst not know man and who didst give birth__ in the flesh to thy Mak-er and thy God, re-joice; and cease not to pray Him, mak-ing en-treat-y for them that wor--ship and praise__ Him that was born of thee._____"
    }
